{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20185",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 3.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.92,
      "end_seconds": 9.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.74,
      "end_seconds": 18.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "Good afternoon, uh, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.31,
      "end_seconds": 24.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 26.12,
      "end_seconds": 33.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Okay, so it's a band-like headache, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.49,
      "end_seconds": 37.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.57,
      "end_seconds": 52.53,
      "duration_seconds": 12.96,
      "text": "Around nearly five years... no wait, you know, it's more like about a year. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.37,
      "end_seconds": 62.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.69,
      "end_seconds": 96.34,
      "duration_seconds": 31.65,
      "text": "Hmm, a three out of ten, I suppose. I get some relief from paracetamol and a head massage. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I've also had a bit of nausea. Mm, um, about bit of nausea, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.86,
      "end_seconds": 100.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Any a stiff neck as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.66,
      "end_seconds": 113.33,
      "duration_seconds": 11.67,
      "text": "Yes, um, about the same, about a year. Erm, you know, as for stiff neck, severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.47,
      "end_seconds": 117.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.9,
      "end_seconds": 123.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, I had a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.96,
      "end_seconds": 127.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.08,
      "end_seconds": 130.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.06,
      "end_seconds": 133.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.8,
      "end_seconds": 146.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.88,
      "end_seconds": 157.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Alright, anxiety, that matches what I have here. Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.27,
      "end_seconds": 163.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.99,
      "end_seconds": 184.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.3,
      "end_seconds": 192.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "I take aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. Paracetamol. I take it most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.34,
      "end_seconds": 196.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.45,
      "end_seconds": 199.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.02,
      "end_seconds": 206.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.45,
      "end_seconds": 219.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.59,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days. I walk the dog every morning. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.96,
      "end_seconds": 222.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Has there been any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.98,
      "end_seconds": 224.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Nope, no vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.48,
      "end_seconds": 231.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Any blurred vision, fever, head injury or jaw pain on chewing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.24,
      "end_seconds": 235.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.79,
      "end_seconds": 239.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Alright, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.22,
      "end_seconds": 243.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.19,
      "end_seconds": 265.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.93,
      "end_seconds": 279.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.2,
      "end_seconds": 299.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 109 over 77, temperature 36.5, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.23,
      "end_seconds": 301.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.49,
      "end_seconds": 307.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.95,
      "end_seconds": 311.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.69,
      "end_seconds": 315.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.78,
      "end_seconds": 340.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Neck muscles are tight and tender, and the eye and limb checks are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.53,
      "end_seconds": 356.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.97,
      "end_seconds": 396.42,
      "duration_seconds": 34.45,
      "text": "Alright, good, you can sit up again. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at tension-type headaches with possible medication overuse or migraine. I'm going to order blood tests, for headache. I'll request a headache diary, it'll help with frequent headaches. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Try to limit painkillers to two days a week and keep a diary of the headaches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.44,
      "end_seconds": 412.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.46,
      "text": "Please don't wait if you get a sudden severe headache or weakness. That's when to be seen urgently. Let's review you in four weeks. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.49,
      "end_seconds": 419.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.74,
      "end_seconds": 426.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.13,
      "end_seconds": 431.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}